---
import HolocronLayout from "../layouts/HolocronLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../data/docs";
import "../styles/landing.css";

const tasks = [
  { number: "01", title: "Install on your computer", text: "Use Node 24.21.0 and your own GitHub login with access to the private release.", href: "/docs/getting-started#install-holocron", label: "Installation guide" },
  { number: "02", title: "Connect the right endpoint", text: "Pair the receiving agent for keys. Connect the Mac’s private MCP tunnel for context.", href: "/docs/getting-started#choose-your-workflow", label: "Choose your workflow" },
  { number: "03", title: "Share with intention", text: "Approve a key request on your Mac, or share the clipboard text and files you select.", href: "/docs/secret-requests", label: "Request your first key" }
];
---

<HolocronLayout title="Holocron | Your context. Your keys. Your call." description={siteConfig.description}>
  <section class="hc-hero shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hc-hero__copy">
      <p class="hc-eyebrow"><span class="hc-seal" aria-hidden="true">◇</span> For the agent on your other computer</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Your context.<br />Your keys.<br /><em>Your call.</em></h1>
      <p class="hc-hero__lede">Give your agent the text it needs and privately provide the API keys it asks for. You choose the context. You approve the keys on your Mac.</p>
      <div class="hc-actions">
        <a class="button button--solid" href="/docs/getting-started">Install Holocron <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="hc-link" href="/docs/secret-requests">Pair your agent <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="hc-prerequisite">Private GitHub access · Node 24.21.0 · macOS + receiving computer</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hc-exchange" role="group" aria-label="Two explicit workflows: selected context through MCP, and approved encrypted keys to a paired receiver">
      <div class="hc-exchange__top"><span class="hc-caption">A deliberate handoff</span><span class="hc-exchange__symbol" aria-hidden="true">◇</span></div>
      <div class="hc-endpoints"><span>Your Mac</span><span aria-hidden="true">↔</span><span>Your agent</span></div>
      <div class="hc-channel">
        <div class="hc-channel__title"><span class="hc-channel__icon" aria-hidden="true">≡</span><h2>The context you select</h2><span class="hc-channel__tag">Share</span></div>
        <p>Clipboard text & selected UTF-8 files</p>
        <div class="hc-rail"><span>Explicit snapshot</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Read through MCP</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hc-channel hc-channel--keys">
        <div class="hc-channel__title"><svg class="hc-channel__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="9" r="4" /><path d="m11 12 8 8m-4-4 3-3m-1 5 3-3" /></svg><h2>The keys you approve</h2><span class="hc-channel__tag">Approve</span></div>
        <p>A native Mac prompt for a paired receiver</p>
        <div class="hc-rail"><span>Encrypted delivery</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span><span>Private key files</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="hc-exchange__note">Keys stay out of chat.<br />Clipboard sharing happens only when you choose.</p>
      <span class="hc-caption hc-exchange__caption">Workflow illustration</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hc-boundaries shell" aria-label="How you stay in control">
    <p><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span> Share selected context</p>
    <p><span aria-hidden="true">◇</span> Approve each key request</p>
    <p><span aria-hidden="true">⌘</span> Paste when you choose</p>
  </section>

  <section class="hc-workflows shell" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
    <div class="hc-section-head"><p class="section-label">Two ways to help your agent</p><h2 id="workflow-title">A little context.<br /><em>A private handoff.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="hc-workflow-grid">
      <article class="hc-workflow">
        <span class="hc-caption">01 / Everyday context</span>
        <h3>Copy. Share. Keep working.</h3>
        <p>Share your copied text once, or select a project file. Your connected agent reads that snapshot. A Raycast shortcut puts the same action a keypress away.</p>
        <div class="docs-copy"><pre><code class="language-sh">holocron copy --name "Project notes"</code></pre></div>
        <p class="hc-code-note">After linking your Mac’s MCP setup. Sharing does not fill the other computer’s clipboard.</p>
        <div class="hc-workflow__links"><a class="hc-link" href="/docs/text-bridge">Share context <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="hc-link" href="/docs/raycast">Set up Raycast <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </article>
      <article class="hc-workflow hc-workflow--keys">
        <span class="hc-caption">02 / Private API keys</span>
        <h3>Your agent asks. You approve.</h3>
        <p>The paired receiving agent requests named keys with a purpose. Review the native Mac prompt and enter the values. Its program reads short-lived private files directly.</p>
        <div class="docs-copy"><pre><code class="language-sh">holocron ask --pairing-file receiver.json \
  -m "Run my approved task" OPENAI_API_KEY</code></pre></div>
        <p class="hc-code-note">After endpoint pairing. Values stay out of chat, clipboard shares and command output.</p>
        <a class="hc-link" href="/docs/secret-requests">Pair & request keys <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hc-start shell" aria-labelledby="start-title">
    <div class="hc-section-head hc-section-head--row"><div><p class="section-label">Start here</p><h2 id="start-title">Make the connection.</h2></div><a class="hc-link" href="/docs/getting-started">Open the setup guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="hc-steps">{tasks.map((task) => (
      <a class="hc-step" href={task.href}><span class="hc-caption">{task.number}</span><h3>{task.title}</h3><p>{task.text}</p><span class="hc-step__link">{task.label} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
    ))}</div>
  </section>

  <section class="hc-close shell" aria-labelledby="close-title">
    <div><p class="section-label">Keep the decision with you</p><h2 id="close-title">Useful context travels.<br /><em>You stay in control.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="hc-close__copy"><p>No clipboard watcher or automatic paste. Key requests need paired endpoints and your native approval. Keep the Mac awake and the relevant service running.</p><p class="hc-acceptance">The private 0.2.0 release and secret relay are live. Test a harmless value on your intended receiver before real keys; receiver and native GUI acceptance is still pending.</p><a class="hc-link" href="/docs/secret-requests#test-the-connection">Test your connection <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  </section>
</HolocronLayout>
